  "kind": "matched = the largest of shared, aligned and the time-only excess among the rules that list the pair, as a share of each edition (of its keys, its single names or its rows with a finish, by that rule); a list is whole when the share is at least four fifths. One race, two years: same_list_twice when the smaller list is whole. Two races, one year: one_race_two_keys when both lists are whole, combined_list when only the smaller is. Two races, two years: same_list_under_another_race when the smaller list is whole. Anything else: partial_overlap",
